{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>立法會今日（14日）有議員接種流感疫苗活動，政府外展隊為逾 40 名議員接種流感疫苗。醫務衞生局局長盧寵茂表示，六月夏季流感至今，成人有 503 宗死亡個案 730 宗嚴重個案；兒童有一人死亡、23 宗重症。今年的流感接種計劃，由上月 17 日開始，接種了 70 萬劑疫苗。 去年共接種了約 203 萬劑。盧寵茂希望今年的接種率可再提高。</p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"877\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261014-YIK_9050-1024x877.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"773\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261014-YIK_9070-1024x773.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"733\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261014-YIK_9057-1024x733.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"728\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261014-YIK_9075-1024x728.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261014-YIK_8987-772x1024.jpeg\" width=\"772\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"703\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261014-YIK_9047-1024x703.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261014-YIK_9027-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"237\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Payme-500x237.png\" width=\"500\"/></figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.707260+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":8,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"wordpress-public-post